==Trivia==
This card's illustration rare print depicts a Ditto in the trees that has transformed into a {{P|Caterpie}}.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX FireRed & LeafGreen|Ditto|4}} from the {{TCG|EX FireRed & LeafGreen}} expansion.
*'''Copy Anything''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Detective Pikachu|Ditto|17}} from the {{TCG|Detective Pikachu}} subset.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

